            "id": "interview-danya-mubarak",
            "type": "interview",
            "title": "Interview with a Classmate",
            "interviewee": "Danya Mubarak",
            "label": "Featured Interview",
            "excerpt": "For this month's interview, we met Danya Mubarak (5C). She's new at our school!",
            "body": "For this month's interview, we wanted to get to know some of our new classmates. I met Danya Mubarak (5C). She's new at our school. I wanted to learn more about her and her hobbies. Read to find out more about her. Welcome Danya!\n\n1. How old are you?\nEleven.\n\n2. What are your favourite things to do?\nCrochet. I like to make robes and hats.\n\n3. Who do you live with? Tell me about them.\nWith my brothers and sisters and mom and dad. My little sister is five, my other sister is eight. I'm the oldest.\n\n4. What three words describe you best?\nConfident, strong, smart.\n\n5. What do you want to be when you grow up?\nA horse-riding coach.\n\n6. Where is your favourite place to go?\nHorse-riding practice.\n\n7. What are you really good at?\nSwimming and horse-riding.\n\n8. If you could have one wish, what would it be?\nAnother sister. I like having sisters a lot!\n\nFive facts about my new friend:\n1. I live in Duhail.\n2. I started horse-riding in January of this year.\n3. My favourite colors are purple and pink.\n4. My favourite subject is PE. Also history, because I like learning about the past.\n5. I had a best friend in Aldaayen School (my old school). Her name is Muna. My friends at Albayan are Fatima, Reem, and Joud.",
            "author": "Fatima Almusaifri (3D)",
            "grade": "3",
            "date": "September 2024",
